        <section id="sm-logger" class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-accent"></div>
          <h2><span class="section-icon">&#9679;</span> Logger &amp; Transports</h2>
          <p>Pino-based structured logging with WebSocket broadcast and transport system.</p>

          <pre><code>{`// All log levels
katax.logger.trace('trace message');
katax.logger.debug('debug message');
katax.logger.info({ message: 'Server started', port: 3000 });
katax.logger.warn({ message: 'High memory', percent: 85 });
